       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TEDDY_BEAR-STANAG-BRIDGE-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-OPERATOR-STATE.
           05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-PARTICIPANT-VALID  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOGAN-ENDOWMENT-SAAT     PIC 9(09) VALUE 001000000.
           05  WS-STANAG-LIVE-TELEMETRY    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DOCUMENT-PIPELINE-ACTIVE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CAJAL-RECURRENT-ROUTING  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-PROOF-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-SSN-DNA-BRIDGE-MET       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIVE-MESH-STABILITY      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-STANAG-PROOF-CODE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-TEDDY_BEAR-ENDOWMENT.
           PERFORM 2000-LINK-STANAG-OPERATIONS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-TEDDY_BEAR-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-TEDDY_BEAR-ENDOWMENT.
           IF WS-HOGAN-ENDOWMENT-SAAT = 001000000 AND
              WS-TEDDY_BEAR-PARTICIPANT-VALID = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SSN-DNA-BRIDGE-MET
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-SSN-DNA-BRIDGE-MET.
       2000-LINK-STANAG-OPERATIONS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIVE-MESH-STABILITY.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-TEDDY_BEAR-PROOF.
           IF WS-SSN-DNA-BRIDGE-MET = 1 AND
              WS-LIVE-MESH-STABILITY = 1 AND
              WS-DOCUMENT-PIPELINE-ACTIVE = 1 AND
              WS-CAJAL-RECURRENT-ROUTING = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-STANAG-PROOF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-STANAG-PROOF-CODE.
